# UI Package (`packages/ui`)

- Build accessible, decoupled React components with explicit TypeScript props.
- Export public components from `src/index.ts`.
- Prefer composition over deep prop drilling.
- Do not depend on Next.js or Zustand; keep this package reusable.
- Style with Tailwind-friendly className props when needed; avoid app-specific logic.
